<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Find a and b from the linear-form line</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>The hyperbolic equation \[ y = \frac{a}{x} + b \] can be written in the linear form \(Y = mX + c\), with:</p>
<p> \(Y = \) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]] and \(X = \) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]].</p>
<p>The straight-line graph of \(Y\) against \(X\) is shown below.</p>
[[jsxgraph width="500px" height="500px"]]
var M={#mm#}, C={#cc#};
var XMIN={#float(xminv)#}, XMAX={#float(xmaxv)#}, YMAX={#float(ymaxv)#}, YMIN={#float(yminv)#};
var brd = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox:[XMIN, YMAX, XMAX, YMIN], axis:true, showCopyright:false, showNavigation:false, grid:true, keepaspectratio:false});
brd.create('text',[XMAX-0.1, -0.5, 'X'],{anchorX:'right',fixed:true,fontSize:14,cssStyle:'font-weight:bold;color:#333'});
brd.create('text',[-0.2, YMAX-0.3, 'Y'],{anchorX:'left',fixed:true,fontSize:14,cssStyle:'font-weight:bold;color:#333'});
brd.create('functiongraph',[function(x){ return M*x + C; }, -2, 2],{strokeColor:'#1f4fd8', strokeWidth:2.5, highlight:false});
brd.create('point',[0,C],{name:'',fixed:true,color:'#cc0000',size:4});

brd.create('segment',[[0,C],[1,C]],{dash:2,strokeColor:'#2ca02c',strokeWidth:2});
brd.create('segment',[[1,C],[1,C+M]],{dash:2,strokeColor:'#2ca02c',strokeWidth:2});


[[/jsxgraph]]
<p>Determine the original constants:</p>
<div>\( a = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<div>\( b = \) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Write the equation as \[ y = a\cdot\frac{1}{x} + b. \] Plotting \(Y=y\) against \(X=\dfrac{1}{x}\) gives \[ Y = a\,X + b. \] Comparing with \(Y=mX+c\): the slope is \(a=m\) and the intercept is \(b=c\).</p>
<p>Since \(m={@mm@}\) and \(c={@cc@}\), the constants are \(a={@mm@}\) and \(b={@cc@}\).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
